'''Magus Accelerant''' is an [[Arcane Enhancement]] for the [[Operator]]. Whenever the Operator performs [[Void Sling]] on an enemy, they will become more vulnerable to {{D|Heat}} damage.

==Effect==
{| class="emodtable"
|-
! Rank
! % Reduced resistance
|-
| 0 || 12%
|-
| 1 || 25%
|-
| 2 || 37%
|-
| 3 || 50%
|-
| 4 || 60%
|-
| 5 || 65%
|}

==Acquisition==
Can be bought from [[Vox Solaris (Syndicate)]] for {{sc|10,000}} upon reaching the rank of '''Shadow'''.

==Notes==
*The effect will apply a permanent stacking [[Damage Vulnerability]] debuff for all {{D|Heat}} damage done to an enemy.
**Can be applied multiple times with no limit, with each application stacking additively with each other.
**For example, using an {{Weapon|Ignis Wraith}} modded with {{M|Serration}} and {{M|Hellfire}} against an enemy affected with '''3''' stacks of a max rank Magus Accelerant will deal:
:::{{Math|35 * (1 + {{M|Serration|165%}}) * (1 + {{M|Hellfire|90%}}) * (1 + 3 * {{Arcane|Magus Accelerant|65%}})|t=y|bf-a=y}} damage before any damage reduction or resistances.
*Has no effect on [[Eidolon]]s.

==Tips==
*Synergizes with {{Arcane|Virtuos Forge}}, {{Arcane|Magus Melt}}, {{Arcane|Magus Cloud}} and many [[Focus/Madurai|Madurai]] nodes.

